 ## A `StreamingResponse` with `yield` { #a-streamingresponse-with-yield }
 
-If you declare a `response_class=StreamingResponse` in your *path operation function*, you can use `yield` to send each chunk of data in turn.
+If you want to stream pure binary data or strings, you should declare `response_class=StreamingResponse` in your *path operation function*. Then you can use `yield` to send each chunk of data in turn.
+
+If you don't declare `response_class=StreamingResponse` but use `yield`, FastAPI will default to streaming as JSON Lines. See [Stream JSON Lines](../tutorial/stream-json-lines.md){.internal-link target=_blank} for more details.
 
